# 3. Capacity Estimation (Very Important for SDE-2)

Example estimation:

* 500M monthly users
* 100M daily active users
* 20M concurrent listeners
* Avg song size:

  * 5 MB compressed AAC/OGG
* Avg listening:

  * 2 hours/day

Bandwidth becomes enormous.

## Traffic Calculation

If 20M users stream at 128 kbps:

20{,}000{,}000 \times 128\text{ kbps}

≈ 2.56 Tbps

This immediately tells interviewer:

* Cannot serve from origin servers
* Need CDN heavily

That’s an important insight.

