# 6. Database Design Discussion

Interviewers LOVE this section.

## What Data Goes Where?

| Data              | DB Choice      | Why                  |
| ----------------- | -------------- | -------------------- |
| User accounts     | SQL            | Strong consistency   |
| Song metadata     | SQL            | Structured relations |
| Playback sessions | Redis          | Fast ephemeral state |
